<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Feral Druid DPS Phase 3</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Feral Druid DPS Phase 3</h3>The 25-man Heroic version (Item Level 258) of the Tier 9 helm is the BiS option for both factions in Phase 3 of WotLK, but will be extremely contested since a maximum of four 258 Tier tokens can drop each week from completing <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="achievement" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/achievement=3818/a-tribute-to-mad-skill-25-player">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crown_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">A Tribute to Mad Skill (25 player)</span></a>. As mentioned in the <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> section above, the best alternative is the 245 Item Level version of the same helm, which should be more practical to obtain since <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trophy_argent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trophy of the Crusade</span></a> drops in both the 10- and 25-man versions of <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50367/arcanum-of-torment">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_rampage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Torment</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/faction=1098/knights-of-the-ebon-blade">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Knights of the Ebon Blade</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
