<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Feral Druid DPS Phase 3</h3>In the glove slot, you will have two BiS options that should be viewed as equal value sidegrades to one another: the 258 Item Level Tier 9 gloves, and the off-set gloves from 10-man Heroic Faction Champions. The Tier gloves are preferable if they unlock one of the set bonuses and you can accommodate the Hit Rating on them, and the off-set gloves are preferable otherwise.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54999/hyperspeed-accelerators">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hyperspeed Accelerators</span></a>, requires <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a>.<br/>If you are not an Engineer, then the best alternative glove enchants are <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44488/enchant-gloves-precision">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_greaterheal.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Precision</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44529/enchant-gloves-major-agility">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Major Agility</span></a> (depending on your available Hit budget).<div class="pad"></div>
