<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Feral Druid DPS Phase 3</h3>Similar to the glove slot, there are three strong leg options to choose from in Phase 3, any of which can be optimal depending on the rest of your itemization. The off-set legs from Heroic Northrend Beasts are the strongest option in isolation, but eat up a lot of Hit budget and do not contribute to a set bonus. If you are one Tier piece away from activating your 2-set or 4-set bonus, then the 258 Item Level version of the Tier 9 legs are a direct swap-in with the same Hit Rating value. Conversely, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45536/legguards-of-cunning-deception">
