<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings for Feral Druid DPS Phase 3</h3>The optimal ring pairing for Feral DPS in Phase 3 is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47075/ring-of-callous-aggression">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_65.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Callous Aggression</span></a> + <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45608/branns-signet-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_67.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brann's Signet Ring</span></a>. Individually, both <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47934/planestalker-signet">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Planestalker Signet</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46048/band-of-lights">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_68.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Lights</span></a> provide higher DPS value in a vacuum, but the Hit Rating on these rings cannot be accommodated in full BiS setups without incurring a larger DPS loss in other gear slots.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44645/enchant-ring-assault">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Assault</span></a>, requires <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=333/enchanting">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchanting</span></a>. <br/>Only Enchanters may apply ring enchants on their own rings.<div class="pad"></div>
