<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Feral Druid DPS Phase 3</h3>The absolute best DPS trinket for Feral Druids in Phase 3 of WotLK continues to be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45931/mjolnir-runestone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rune_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mjolnir Runestone</span></a>, which is now even more valuable than it was in early Phase 2 due to <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=413895/glyph-of-omen-of-clarity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Glyph of Omen of Clarity</span></a>. The Glyph dramatically increases the frequency of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=48572/shred">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_vampiricaura.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shred</span></a> casts in the DPS rotation, and therefore makes Armor Penetration procs (which buff <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=48572/shred">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_vampiricaura.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shred</span></a> damage but not bleed damage) more impactful than before.<br/>
<br/>
<a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> introduces a new optimal trinket to pair with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45931/mjolnir-runestone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rune_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mjolnir Runestone</span></a> in the second trinket slot: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47131/deaths-verdict">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death's Verdict</span></a> /<wbr/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47464/deaths-choice">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death's Choice</span></a> off the Twin Val'kyr. The Heroic version of the trinket provides a significant 100 DPS bump over <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45609/comets-trail">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_starfire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Comet's Trail</span></a>, but will be extremely contested in most raid teams and will often be prioritized to Strength users.<br/>
<br/>Note that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46038/dark-matter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_seedofdestruction.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Matter</span></a>, which was competitive with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45609/comets-trail">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_starfire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Comet's Trail</span></a> for Ferals in Phase 2, will drop in value when you are decked out in Phase 3 gear due to the Crit soft cap. The 70.67% effective soft cap mentioned at the start of this guide when using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47668/idol-of-mutilation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qirajidol_strife.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of Mutilation</span></a> + <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47131/deaths-verdict">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death's Verdict</span></a> drops to only 62.87% when using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46038/dark-matter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_seedofdestruction.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Matter</span></a> instead in the second trinket slot, making it impossible to extract full value from Crit on the rest of your gear during an <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=65024/implosion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_bloodnova.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Implosion</span></a> proc.<div class="pad"></div>
