<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="idols-for-feral-druid-dps-phase-3">Idols for Feral Druid DPS Phase 3</h4>Phase 3 finally introduces a new cat DPS Idol to replace <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40713/idol-of-the-ravenous-beast">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_relics_idolofferocity.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of the Ravenous Beast</span></a> from Phase 1 pre-raid gearing. The <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> reward <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47668/idol-of-mutilation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qirajidol_strife.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of Mutilation</span></a> provides a hefty 110 DPS increase over <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40713/idol-of-the-ravenous-beast">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_relics_idolofferocity.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of the Ravenous Beast</span></a> and should be a priority to obtain early on in the phase. Keep in mind that once you purchase <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47668/idol-of-mutilation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qirajidol_strife.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of Mutilation</span></a>, your effective Crit soft cap will drop by 2.85%, so you may need to swap some of your existing gems from Agility to Strength or from Crit to Haste so as to maximize the benefit of the new Idol.<br/>
<br/>Also note that since bearweaving is no longer frequently performed as part of the optimal DPS rotation (due to <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=413895/glyph-of-omen-of-clarity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Glyph of Omen of Clarity</span></a>), there will no longer be opportunities to efficiently Idol swap mid-combat without incurring a costly swing timer reset and/<wbr/>or GCD extension. As a result, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47668/idol-of-mutilation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qirajidol_strife.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of Mutilation</span></a> should be permanently equipped once you obtain it.<div class="pad"></div>
